    "long_instructions": "## Practice: Dot vs. Bracket Notation\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. In `prompt.md`, ask AI how to update object properties using dot notation and bracket notation.\r\n\r\n2. Use AI Tutor to update values in your `dessert` object using both methods.\r\n\r\n3. Check your work:\r\n   - Did the values change on the page?\r\n   - Where is dot notation used?\r\n   - Where is bracket notation used?",
